    {
      "v": "yejin",
      "t": "지난번도 느낀 건데 너 누구한테 연애를 가르치니?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "From \"budongsan\" for real estate to \"chingu\" for friend, you can follow sharp sibling truths in Korean dramas. Until next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "yejoon",
      "t": "안녕히 계세요.",
      "gap": 0.3
